OL,3,GNEWSAGavin and Stacey star revealed
OL,4,Afinale secret to Strictly friend
OL,5,
OL,6,FGavin and Stacey star Laura Aikman was
OL,7,Fsworn to secrecy before making her
OL,8,Fshock return in the show's finale, but
OL,9,Fshe has revealed she did tell actress
OL,10,Fpal Sarah Hadland.
OL,12,FAikman, who played Smithy's
OL,13,Fex-girlfriend Sonia, was revealed at
OL,14,Fthe start of the 2024 Christmas show as
OL,15,Fhis bride-to-be.
OL,17,FMiranda star Hadland had told Aikman
OL,18,Fshe had a secret, so Aikman said:
OL,19,F"Well, I'll tell you mine if you tell
OL,20,Fme yours."
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
